Data and Derived Outputs
========================

Raw BrainGraph, Human Connectome Project, and OASIS-3 data are not redistributed
in this repository and remain subject to their original data-use terms. Compact
derived non-identifying summary outputs are provided to support review and
reproducibility of the manuscript.
